# Allowlist: upload only what the deploy needs, so `vercel deploy` from a laptop never ships
# .env, data/, truth/ or .venv (the CLI does not read .gitignore). D35, D37.
# requirements.txt (not pyproject.toml) gives the function only its runtime deps.
/*
!api
!src
!web
!vercel.json
!requirements.txt
!.python-version
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
